{"ID":"20240513083014-erhopgk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083014-erhopgk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083014-erhopgk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513173007-6sf5s2a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513173007-6sf5s2a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513173007-6sf5s2a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:594,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:594\u0026#125;","title":"302","type":"doc","updated":"20240513173007"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513173007-6sf5s2a","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1023px;","id":"20240513173007-6sf5s2a","updated":"20240513173007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      初診日期：2008/03/24"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"221-5 L, J"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"46，微胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/04/04"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後回診，今天將結束兩周於Florida的診療回New Jersey。感覺左臂、右腿與左大腿下仍微微瞤動。左側不冷了。不會一下怕熱怕冷了。睡時偶仍須大口吸氣(因此人氣虛)。腳水腫漸消。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診\n睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，無盜汗了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"飲食："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不喝可樂了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"排氣："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服了加入石膏知母之前方後，易排氣了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"變小了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"頭身："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左手大拇指無僵硬，但右手大拇指稍不靈活，感覺隱隱要發。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尚好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日行。2~3次/天。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"稍數有力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎陽反應仍差。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"額熱仍有一點。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此人現在T5、T6的壓痛已好轉許多。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下三皇穴 巨闕 關元 公孫 內關 足三里"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"督俞 靈台 心俞 委中 腎俞 京門 承山"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太白 太淵"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1) 同3/24方 加 石膏一兩 知母五錢五付 九碗煮三碗 早晚飯前 熱藥冷服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2) HT-48一斤 30x2 午飯與睡覺前"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1) 此人肌肉無法控制為陽虛，左足肌肉萎縮為陰虛。現陽回則以八味地黃丸來收尾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2) 八味地黃丸吃到大便不易出表陽已固則可停。但若肌肉仍無力可改六味地黃丸。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(3) 肌肉瞤動表示皮下肌肉有水，新水無法取代舊水。此人身內寒水過多，躺在床上會突然冒汗，是因為氣化的水被寒水堵住，無法為人受用反逆而出。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(4) 腳就是腎，此人腎陽極虛故腳無力。多走路會幫助甚大，因為運動會使陽升。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}